From f55bb17ddb2fd64e039057bf7ee50951a0dc93e8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Scott Moser <smoser@ubuntu.com>
Date: Thu, 20 Dec 2018 17:22:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Vmware: Add support for the com.vmware.guestInfo OVF
 transport.

This adds support for reading OVF information over the
'com.vmware.guestInfo' tranport.  The current implementation requires
vmware-rpctool be installed in the system.

LP: #1807466
---
